        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "bca59c06-c8da-3945-81f8-1b5bbf98f9bd",
                "word": "rodomontade",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "40d4314f-d14d-4782-92a8-51fbf20bbecf",
                        "entry_id": "bca59c06-c8da-3945-81f8-1b5bbf98f9bd",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "rodomontades"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "55c671df-e8e2-387c-9261-cd1c37c39c67",
                        "entry_id": "bca59c06-c8da-3945-81f8-1b5bbf98f9bd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Attitude prétentieuse et ridicule, langage d’un rodomont, fanfaronnade."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bb496c6-753f-486f-9344-cff34a4cffcd",
                                "sense_id": "55c671df-e8e2-387c-9261-cd1c37c39c67",
                                "text": "Le capitaine oserait-il venir ? ou bien sa proposition n’était-elle qu’une rodomontade ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4e9f485-409b-425c-8e69-695c5b55ccb5",
                                "sense_id": "55c671df-e8e2-387c-9261-cd1c37c39c67",
                                "text": "Par sécheresse de cœur et par ironie, il s’était interdit de nourrir des idées sur le monde. Philosophie, art, politique ou morale, tout système lui paraissait une impossible rodomontade. Aussi, faute d’être soutenu par des idées, le monde était si inconsistant qu’il ne lui offrait aucun appui. Les seuls solides gardaient pour lui une forme."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db7438cf-1401-4034-b9c1-7d970f515083",
                                "sense_id": "55c671df-e8e2-387c-9261-cd1c37c39c67",
                                "text": "Nous avons échangé mensonges et rodomontades en engloutissant des tonnelets de bière."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "506b6fc7-6eca-40e7-b734-94891ac0c733",
                                "sense_id": "55c671df-e8e2-387c-9261-cd1c37c39c67",
                                "text": "La loi est plus proche des rodomontades de « bravitude » énoncées par les donneuses de leçons calfeutrées dans leur confort bien pensant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0afb6afb-48c9-41dd-a2e3-c1f002e22ba4",
                                "sense_id": "55c671df-e8e2-387c-9261-cd1c37c39c67",
                                "text": "Ses rodomontades ne convainquent plus personne."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3ae89a9c-b3fe-4a32-84a2-d7aa6d8372c8",
                        "source_entry_id": "bca59c06-c8da-3945-81f8-1b5bbf98f9bd",
                        "source_sense_id": "55c671df-e8e2-387c-9261-cd1c37c39c67",
                        "target_lang_word": "Prahlerei",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Prahlerei",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc3bd626-4881-3d94-98d7-83f029bb7b3d",
                                        "entry_id": "dc6eb28c-c5a0-3f99-a7a2-6f743537e0d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "übertriebene Betonung/Hervorhebung von etwas, mit dem sich der Sprecher selbst lobt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d8833d2-791e-4c1c-8b93-b8bea2eb9990",
                                                "sense_id": "bc3bd626-4881-3d94-98d7-83f029bb7b3d",
                                                "text": "„Das war keine Prahlerei, sondern eher Untertreibung.“."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b01944cc-a642-4e9a-beff-4e9a2ffaf5c2",
                                                "sense_id": "bc3bd626-4881-3d94-98d7-83f029bb7b3d",
                                                "text": "„Man hatte bald genug, übergenug von diesem Querulanten und seiner Prahlerei, er sei schließlich schon ein Wunderkind gewesen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05110552-ab50-4d1f-8ea3-04a7d92c3fde",
                                                "sense_id": "bc3bd626-4881-3d94-98d7-83f029bb7b3d",
                                                "text": "„Nationen bestehen aus einzelnen Menschen, und nicht jeder ist bereit, der Prahlerei und Rüpelei seiner Regierung Beifall zu spenden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "680cc527-e4b8-44c5-bef1-e0d4cfa0442a",
                                                "sense_id": "bc3bd626-4881-3d94-98d7-83f029bb7b3d",
                                                "text": "„Der Ausdruck des jungen Mannes der Indianerin gegenüber hatte jene hier ziemlich alberne Prahlerei angenommen, der sich jedoch auch der sonst vernünftige Brite so gerne und nie mehr als dann überläßt, wenn es sein Vorteil zu erheischen scheint, Fremden eine recht große Idee von seinem Lande und so gelegentlich von sich selbst beizubringen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2772bde8-dd8b-4002-8975-d7d205c4a0cc",
                        "source_entry_id": "bca59c06-c8da-3945-81f8-1b5bbf98f9bd",
                        "source_sense_id": "55c671df-e8e2-387c-9261-cd1c37c39c67",
                        "target_lang_word": "rodomontade",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rodomontade",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5464ebf-1f1f-3eb3-9ee3-01f0be88ffb2",
                                        "entry_id": "36185f5d-52a2-3948-8c26-3dc6dd9fdea8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vain boasting; a rant; pretentious behaviour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76b7c97b-5a21-420e-9b75-91164003da04",
                                                "sense_id": "d5464ebf-1f1f-3eb3-9ee3-01f0be88ffb2",
                                                "text": "[…] the Gasconads of France, Rodomontads of Spain, Fanfaronads of Italy, and Bragadochio brags of all other countries, could no more astonish his invincible heart, then would the cheeping of a mouse a bear robbed of her whelps."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fb7ca01-5c8a-4fb1-bb5f-857dd46a3403",
                                                "sense_id": "d5464ebf-1f1f-3eb3-9ee3-01f0be88ffb2",
                                                "text": "Indeed, there is much Reaſon to imagine, that there was not the leaſt Truth in what Mr. Weſtern affirmed, eſpecially as he laid the Scene of thoſe Impurities at the Univerſity, where Mr. Allworthy had never been. In fact, the good Squire was a little too apt to indulge that Kind of Pleaſantry which is generally called Rodomontade; but which may, with as much Propriety, be expreſſed by a much ſhorter Word; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "350eae30-c2e2-4287-809b-27d77876d93c",
                                                "sense_id": "d5464ebf-1f1f-3eb3-9ee3-01f0be88ffb2",
                                                "text": "Not a glimpse can you get of the merits or defects of the performers: they are hidden in a profusion of barbarous epithets and wilful rhodomontade."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dd972a2-1154-4bad-a0a7-75abe3258a9a",
                                                "sense_id": "d5464ebf-1f1f-3eb3-9ee3-01f0be88ffb2",
                                                "text": "Many of her ladyship’s letters were the most whimsical rhodomontades that ever blue-stocking penned."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be7ce07a-eb13-4a05-b729-1f7a911ff821",
                                                "sense_id": "d5464ebf-1f1f-3eb3-9ee3-01f0be88ffb2",
                                                "text": "He talks of her abroad as a stern and rigid master dealing with a naughty slave, though, by the look that accompanies his rhodomontade, I am convinced that at home he is the very model of \"managed men.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2c2af39-9181-4d9b-8c79-d138fa0e8133",
                                                "sense_id": "d5464ebf-1f1f-3eb3-9ee3-01f0be88ffb2",
                                                "text": "[…]Euripides accuses Æschylus of being ‘pomp-bundle-worded,’ which I suppose means bombastic and given to rodomontade […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f77b92e-f921-4523-a16d-cfe551d40161",
                                                "sense_id": "d5464ebf-1f1f-3eb3-9ee3-01f0be88ffb2",
                                                "text": "Bragging was the vice that was Eichmann's undoing. It was sheer rodomontade when he told his men during the last days of the war: “I will jump into my grave laughing, because the fact that I have the death of five million Jews [or “enemies of the Reich,” as he always claimed to have said]^([sic]) on my conscience gives me extraordinary satisfaction.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "rodomontade",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42ab5ec4-4dfe-3399-aee0-bc1a459af23e",
